    "type": "game",
    "name": "Matsudaira's Myoshu: A Sengoku Village Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 2751770,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "Step back in time to an era of honor and strife in 'Matsudaira's Myoshu,' where you, as the myoshu for the daimyo, Matsudaira Hirotada, will face the ultimate challenge of transforming your tiny hamlet into a thriving, fortified stronghold. In this casual immersive village builder, you hold the destiny of your people in your hands. Begin with an administration building and a mission, then lead your villagers to prosperity, from peaceful farms and temples to grand Zen Gardens that attract traveling monks, inspiring hope and happiness wherever they roam and play at your own pace. Your ultimate goal? The construction of a magnificent castle, the symbol of your authority and the beacon of hope in a land torn by strife. The Sengoku period is unforgiving, but your indomitable spirit will see your village through the storm.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751770/extras/ca1fd5ae6e96211a2ddb35ec82f9039b.poster.avif?t=1718982001\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751770/extras/ca1fd5ae6e96211a2ddb35ec82f9039b.webm?t=1718982001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751770/extras/ca1fd5ae6e96211a2ddb35ec82f9039b.mp4?t=1718982001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Prepare for the perils that lurk both day and night as you defend against Ronin, raiders, and stealthy ninja by erecting arrow guard towers and arming your villagers. Engage in exhilarating combat as you train your warriors, for in this turbulent era, peace can only be secured through strength.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751770/extras/374bee0f43876ba1f8c2b900b9285ac6.poster.avif?t=1718982001\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751770/extras/374bee0f43876ba1f8c2b900b9285ac6.webm?t=1718982001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751770/extras/374bee0f43876ba1f8c2b900b9285ac6.mp4?t=1718982001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Scour lush forests and fertile lands for vital resources, gathering wood, stone, and food to sustain your growing settlement. Utilize these resources to cook nourishing meals in your bustling kitchen, ensuring the well-being of your villagers. However, beware the specter of famine and the burden of war taxes that may darken your path. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751770/extras/a75855d132e4490f35cf3d05923761d8.poster.avif?t=1718982001\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751770/extras/a75855d132e4490f35cf3d05923761d8.webm?t=1718982001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751770/extras/a75855d132e4490f35cf3d05923761d8.mp4?t=1718982001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Welcome traders from neighboring villages and afar, engaging in shrewd trading to acquire the resources you lack and forge alliances that bolster your ascent to greatness. Barter surplus goods for items crucial to your village's development, from weapons and armor to specialized tools and building materials.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751770/extras/9e06055ab0733f810ffd80c200a66f6e.poster.avif?t=1718982001\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751770/extras/9e06055ab0733f810ffd80c200a66f6e.webm?t=1718982001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751770/extras/9e06055ab0733f810ffd80c200a66f6e.mp4?t=1718982001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Embrace the intricacies of village management as you oversee building construction, crafting, and resource gathering. Upgrade your structures to enhance efficiency and unlock new technologies through a comprehensive Tech Tree. Manage your villagers' well-being, from their health and hunger to their happiness and skills, ensuring their optimal performance in times of peace and war.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751770/extras/f68c5d8b79d87d31c0967b61d52a4d93.poster.avif?t=1718982001\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751770/extras/f68c5d8b79d87d31c0967b61d52a4d93.webm?t=1718982001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751770/extras/f68c5d8b79d87d31c0967b61d52a4d93.mp4?t=1718982001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Navigate the passage of time with a dynamic day/night cycle and mark the seasons with holidays and festivals that enrich the cultural tapestry of your village. Save and load your progress as you embark on your journey, encountering various events and objectives that challenge your leadership and decision-making skills.<br><br>&quot;Matsudaira's Myoshu&quot; invites you to experience the excitement and challenges of a pivotal historical era. Can you rise from a humble village to become a Myoshu of legend, forging a legacy of prosperity, strength, and honor? Your journey begins here, where you'll shape the destiny of your people and leave an enduring mark on the pages of history.",
    "about_the_game": "Step back in time to an era of honor and strife in 'Matsudaira's Myoshu,' where you, as the myoshu for the daimyo, Matsudaira Hirotada, will face the ultimate challenge of transforming your tiny hamlet into a thriving, fortified stronghold. In this casual immersive village builder, you hold the destiny of your people in your hands. Begin with an administration building and a mission, then lead your villagers to prosperity, from peaceful farms and temples to grand Zen Gardens that attract traveling monks, inspiring hope and happiness wherever they roam and play at your own pace. Your ultimate goal? The construction of a magnificent castle, the symbol of your authority and the beacon of hope in a land torn by strife. The Sengoku period is unforgiving, but your indomitable spirit will see your village through the storm.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751770/extras/ca1fd5ae6e96211a2ddb35ec82f9039b.poster.avif?t=1718982001\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751770/extras/ca1fd5ae6e96211a2ddb35ec82f9039b.webm?t=1718982001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751770/extras/ca1fd5ae6e96211a2ddb35ec82f9039b.mp4?t=1718982001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Prepare for the perils that lurk both day and night as you defend against Ronin, raiders, and stealthy ninja by erecting arrow guard towers and arming your villagers. Engage in exhilarating combat as you train your warriors, for in this turbulent era, peace can only be secured through strength.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751770/extras/374bee0f43876ba1f8c2b900b9285ac6.poster.avif?t=1718982001\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751770/extras/374bee0f43876ba1f8c2b900b9285ac6.webm?t=1718982001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751770/extras/374bee0f43876ba1f8c2b900b9285ac6.mp4?t=1718982001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Scour lush forests and fertile lands for vital resources, gathering wood, stone, and food to sustain your growing settlement. Utilize these resources to cook nourishing meals in your bustling kitchen, ensuring the well-being of your villagers. However, beware the specter of famine and the burden of war taxes that may darken your path. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751770/extras/a75855d132e4490f35cf3d05923761d8.poster.avif?t=1718982001\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751770/extras/a75855d132e4490f35cf3d05923761d8.webm?t=1718982001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751770/extras/a75855d132e4490f35cf3d05923761d8.mp4?t=1718982001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Welcome traders from neighboring villages and afar, engaging in shrewd trading to acquire the resources you lack and forge alliances that bolster your ascent to greatness. Barter surplus goods for items crucial to your village's development, from weapons and armor to specialized tools and building materials.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751770/extras/9e06055ab0733f810ffd80c200a66f6e.poster.avif?t=1718982001\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.ste